  "description": "Pinned unmodified ZipCPU wbdmac: autonomous pipelined Wishbone memory master plus pipelined registered-ack control target. Static physical/source declaration only. Composite runtime, driver and session are unsupported pending DMA Slice B/C. Master addresses are 30-bit words; no SEL pin exists on either interface. Immediate trigger pins fixed zero in initial environment; no DMA data or IRQ simulated. Executable RTL start key is 0xfed, not stale header 0x3db.",
